--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
u4# show ip igmp groups
                                             <- baseline: no membership

>>> host: IGMPv1 membership report (type 0x12) src=10.10.10.20 gaddr=239.1.1.1

u4# show ip igmp groups
IGMP Connected Group Membership
Group Address    Interface            Uptime   Expires  Last Reporter
239.1.1.1        vlan10               00:00:02 00:04:17 10.10.10.20

u4# show ip igmp groups 239.1.1.1 detail
Interface:      vlan10
Group:          239.1.1.1
Group mode:     Exclude (Expires: 00:04:16)
Last reporter:  10.10.10.20
Source list is empty
  => DUT registered the IGMPv1 report.

